"title_0" = "True Status";
"title_1" = "Your helpers, tips and advice";
"title_2" = "Aim worth aiming for";
"title_3" = "What needs to be done to stabilize the situation";

"fool_financial" = "You can safely spend money on adventure and exploration. Want to take a trip or learn a new skill? You can easily afford it now. No need to worry about bills, it is better to satisfy your curiosity. You just need new experiences. Also, the card may indicate that your activity needs a new idea, a new project, it is a fresh look that will allow you to get on the road to success.";
"magicianCard_financial" = "Thanks to your enterprise and the use of your abilities, you can get a decent profit. Your knowledge and skills will be appreciated and will help you earn. You are a very powerful person and now your financial component is exclusively in your hands and your success depends only on you, you are capable of it.";
"highpriestessCard_financial" = "The high priestess says that you are quite impractical in regards to money and possessions. But at the same time, you have the ability to intuitively make the right decision. Also, this card may indicate the presence of hidden factors affecting the financial situation and working moments.";
"empressCard_financial" = "You have financial stability, or it is waiting for you soon. Reasonable use of your material resources, moreover, available in abundance. Well-being in monetary matters, growing wealth. If you are not in such energies and your finances are not in order - get planning and start developing your new ideas - they will lead you to growth and well-being.";
"emperorCard_financial" = "The emperor card guarantees you the potential to achieve your success in the financial sector: legal income, wise management of your money resources: stabilization of the financial situation: favorable housing situation: resolution of legal issues and problems related to real estate. You are energetically very strong and powerful person and will be able to solve and achieve any goal set for yourself.";
"hierophantCard_financial" = "The Hierophant card says that you need to follow the instructions and play by the rules. The card does not exclude making a profit, but still sets you up in that direction, making it clear that money is not the main thing. The most important thing for you now is to find your right spiritual path and step on it, being able to keep moving in the chosen direction. It is very likely that higher powers lead you to a fateful road or to your destination.";
"lovesCard_financial" = "Lovers tell you that there is a high probability of making a profit as a result of your union with a partner (business or not). Perhaps your spouse or loved one will provide significant assistance. It may also indicate the receipt of financial support for the development of your project. Or it may hint to you that the time has come to make a final decision and your business will go uphill, gaining stable growth.";
"chariotCard_financial" = "In financial matters, an improvement in your financial situation awaits you, and it can happen after some time thanks to your energetic actions and determination. You are a person with sufficient pride and love for luxury, therefore, taking a certain standard of living as a guideline and setting yourself the goal of achieving it, you will definitely achieve results. The map can also indicate a goal you have already set and movement towards it. You are quite concentrated in this process and with this approach you will definitely achieve results.";
"strengthCard_financial" = "Thanks to work and your strong-willed inclinations, you will achieve financial well-being. Either you are already wisely and calmly conducting your activities in growth and abundance, or the card hints that moving away from hasty decisions, impulsiveness and competitive struggle, you will build your financial well-being using your inner powerful qualities and the strength of your spirit.";
"hermitCard_financial" = "The hermit may advise you to simply ignore financial issues and look at the matter from some other angle, making it clear that money is not the main thing. The financial component of your life could lead you to the depletion of your life resources and you need to reevaluate your being: whether you are moving in the right direction, whether you are engaged in the right activity. Try to feel yourself as much as possible and realize that you may have come to the stage when it is time to start mentoring and sharing your experience.";
"wheelOfFortune_financial" = "Your current situation with finances and work issues is not entirely in your control. You have entered a period where you are dealing with the consequences of past decisions. But this period can bring you many pleasant and unexpected prospects, grasping which your business will go uphill and various new opportunities will turn up. By not missing this unusual period and taking the bull by the horns, you can find prosperity, improvement, success due to circumstances that may seem like pure luck, as well as the possibility of unexpected gain.";
"justiceCard_financial" = "Justice speaks of an equal and fair distribution of income, as well as receiving money in an honest way. If work matters relate to litigation, then the card marks the triumph of a worthy party in court in resolving a legal issue relating to property or money. She can also talk about paying off debt, and receiving monetary compensation, financial balance, as well as solving tax issues. And everything will be resolved successfully if you approach decisions honestly and responsibly.";
"hangedCard_financial" = "The Hanged Man card can signal to you about rather difficult financial conditions in your life during a given period of time in your life, such as: loss of funds, loss of housing, the need to save, cut costs, material losses, loss of income sources, forced sale of valuables, parting with part of your stability. At this point in time is not the time to take drastic action to address these problems. You need to seriously think and analyze in detail why and how this happens. Look a little deeper into yourself, rather than superficially assessing losses.";
"deathCard_financial" = "Death may indicate to you a change in career goals, the termination of any activity, or even retirement. The card marks the end of an important cycle and the transition to a new one: a change in profession, the direction of your business, moving up the career ladder, leaving for a new job or completing an old one. That is, in any case, the end of something due to the fact that it has become obsolete. The card advises you to say goodbye to a position or job that you are already used to. Internally prepare yourself for this: get rid of the past so that you can expect new changes from the fate.";
"moderationCard_financial" = "Moderation can speak of savings and unfortunately does not promise great wealth. But at the same time, it guarantees a stable and fairly even state of affairs. This card is good for those who have already lost their stability or well-being, because it says that in general everything will be fine, just without surpluses and rapid growth. Perhaps right now you need to stabilize this moment for yourself before embarking on more ambitious plans.";
"devilCard_financial" = "The devil is a symbol of profit and venality, commercialism and charging fees with interest. You may focus solely on achieving material wealth and are prone to an uncontrollable thirst to chase endless new acquisitions. In general, for finances, this card predicts abundance and monetary take-off.";
"towerCard_financial" = "Since the Tower is a rather fatalistic card, it can tell you about a sharp loss of a job, a business collapse, or an unexpectedly worthless investment. It can also indicate a defeat in the fight against competitors, a sudden bankruptcy, the collapse of a working project, a loss of reputation and influence, removal from your usual position. In general, everything related to monetary losses, sudden poverty. In general, the circumstances are quite difficult and the only thing you can do now is to accept the blow of fate with dignity and draw a parallel with your past, analyzing why this happened and what your decisions and positions led to this. In any case, over time, you will realize that what you no longer need has collapsed, what has become obsolete and does not bring you development, but only pulled you down.";
"starCard_financial" = "The card tells you that the achievement of material goals and plans you have conceived is just around the corner. As you work to secure your future financially, don't forget to appreciate what you already have, it will inspire you to keep moving forward. The star can also say that thanks to your activities you will become a famous and popular person. And also fulfill your dreams regarding financial well-being. You can expect new perspectives, projects and proposals.";
"moonCard_financial" = "The moon may indicate illegal business, shady deals, not entirely honest contracts, fears and worries about work, tangled relationships in a team with employees or partners: deceit, slander, intrigue, gossip and secrets around your activities. The card can also talk about you as a creative person and you react very subtly to the phenomena of the world around you and can run away from reality. If we talk about professional affiliation, then in the best interpretation, the card speaks of psychics, mediums, magicians, psychotherapists, magicians, illusionists. If your activity is in no way connected with this, then most likely there are conspiracies around you that warn you of danger. It is best for you to lie low now in order to try to avoid trouble and find out all the circumstances.";
"sunCard_financial" = "The sun speaks of the onset of a bright streak in your activity. You can experience complete satisfaction with your work and its results. Or get inspired by a new promising project that will lead you to success. In any case, the card promises you a warm atmosphere within your work team, professional growth, self-realization, successful business, wealth, and successful investments. In general, a period of prosperity, well-being and creative flight begins for you.";
"doomsdayCard_financial" = "You will find a way out of the crisis if the circumstances of financial affairs were unfavorable. This can also be solved by inviting to a new job, the emergence of important responsible matters, even returning to an old profession or returning to old projects after a state of stagnation, career growth, in general, a fundamental change in the financial situation. The professional direction that will be successful for you may be related to show business, litigation, rhetoric, teaching, as well as work that involves public speaking. Strength from above helps you to renew your financial well-being.";
"worldCard_financial" = "The World card is a complete success achieved by one's own labor. The card says that you are following your true calling, which will bring you triumph, victory, the end of the old stage and the beginning of a new one, great achievements, business expansion, entering the international level if you run your own business .. In any case, the card marks you the successful resolution of all problems, perhaps even buying your own house or receiving an inheritance. That is, the financial sector will succeed, even if you are currently experiencing difficulties.";

//Figure

"pageOfPentacles_financial" = "You are focused on making plans for the future and achieving your goals. And your ideas are quite down to earth and realistic. You also appreciate nature and all its gifts. The card indicates to you that you need to complete what you started. Or your plans and their implementation can be helped by a self-contained and meek man, most likely young.";
"pageOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates to you extremely unpleasant news, uncertainty and anxiety in some situation, in working moments and financial matters. It can portend difficulties, troubles and financial problems that will not lead to anything good and can only complicate your financial transactions, although it does not portend big changes for the worse.";
"pageOfWands_financial" = "Soon you will receive a decent amount of money. Probably, either someone will give them to you, or the boss will unexpectedly issue a bonus. Do not rush to make unplanned purchases, it is better to save money for the future. The thicker the financial cushion, the better you will feel in difficult times. Or you will be inspired by a new interesting idea regarding working moments and it is up to you whether you can transform this idea into something more.";
"pageOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates the receipt of good news, prosperity in the house, improvement in circumstances and gaining material support from influential people and relatives. The card predicts joy, good news and promises, a meeting with a person who will set a new direction for your life. You may also have a new idea for a great new project that will inspire you.";
"knightOfPentacles_financial" = "It is not necessary to count on the solution of financial issues in the near future. Before you manage to achieve the implementation of the plan, a lot of time will pass and you need to focus on business and plans, a sufficient amount of your efforts will be required. The card also indicates earnings as a result of honest work and prudent actions, your ability to properly dispose of what you have. She also warns you against any risky fraud and the pursuit of easy money.";
"knightOfSwords_financial" = "The Knight of Swords says that you probably want to cut costs and increase profits. To achieve this goal, you will need a lot of energy. Concentrate and do not be afraid, everything will work out! Also, this card may indicate that a man, possibly an air sign of the zodiac, is negatively disposed towards you, or a person with destructive energy and he intends to challenge you.";
"knightOfWands_financial" = "In work and financial matters, the Knight of Wands promises change. Also, in matters of earnings, the emergence of new alluring options is possible in comparison with the current state of affairs. Or this card can talk about the appearance in your environment of a person who will offer you an interesting joint creative activity or a prospect open to you.";
"knightOfCups_financial" = "The card may hint at the imminent receipt of money or at least a profitable offer, some encouraging information. In any case, the news will be pleasant for you. Such an event may be a kind of advance for you from higher powers. Also, the card can talk about your inspiration and commitment to what you are doing, or will soon be doing. This is the case when work or activity is for love.";
"kingOfPentacles_financial" = "If you have your own business, then it will flourish and bring good results. Stability is present at the moment, and will be in the future. If you are employed, you will definitely get a promotion at work, an increase in salary. All matters will be resolved very soon. If you need advice regarding financial matters, you will soon receive it from a person of status and older than you, who treats you favorably and positively.";
"kingOfSwords_financial" = "The King of Swords recommends that you be disciplined when it comes to finances. Make sure you are doing everything you can to achieve your goals. Remember that sometimes you have to sacrifice something. Analyze the situation before making decisions related to money. The card also indicates to you that in order to get what you want, you will need to strategize and win back your status.";
"kingOfWands_financial" = "The King of Wands is a card of quick success, acquisition of property, manifestation of thriftiness and leadership qualities. She points to career success, a quick and unexpected receipt of money, new favorable opportunities not only for finding one's place in the sun, but also help from an influential and wealthy person with a certain status. Go ahead without fear. Your energy and passion will lead you to success.";
"kingOfCups_financial" = "The King of Cups indicates maturity and experience, gaining material support and help from an influential and experienced person. Your cases will improve, you may get the help of a lawyer in court cases or an improvement in circumstances that will help you achieve a stable financial situation and success.";
"queenOfPentacles_financial" = "The Queen of Pentacles indicates joy and good news that will come in handy. Also, strengthening your financial situation can occur with the help of a woman. The card indicates stability and prosperity, spending not only on practical things, but also on what is pleasant, on gold, expensive pleasures, but at the same time useful and refined things.";
"queenOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates bad news, deceit and fraud on the part of a woman, the appearance of negative information, aggressiveness and anger. It is possible that someone deliberately harms you or misleads you in order to take advantage of a favorable set of circumstances. Such a card portends all sorts of troubles, conflicts and problems in the business sphere.";
"queenOfWands_financial" = "The Queen of Wands denotes a leadership position. She can tell you about some kind of race for a better life, a desire to test yourself for strength. It can also indicate the boss or an important employee, on whom the outcome of the common cause will depend. This card predicts an active period, which in the future will help in moving up the career ladder. At this time, it is important for you to focus on your own personality and take responsibility. The Queen of Wands shows money luck.";
"queenOfCups_financial" = "The card indicates to you a pleasant pastime, holidays and communication with pleasant and bright people. She can talk about entertainment, spending, frivolous acts that cannot negatively affect the budget in any way, but business people should be more careful and control their spending on women. In general, in finance, a fairly calm, measured and satisfactory period awaits you.";

//Numeral

"aceOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates to you a chance to change your financial situation for the better, it may also portend wealth and gain in business. This is the most favorable card in financial layouts, it indicates wealth, happiness, good material opportunities that will help you cope with all difficulties and gain influence and power, the ability to significantly expand your horizons.";
"aceOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates a dubious chance to change your financial situation for the better, which can be dangerous and lead to unjustified risk. A card can promise you success only if you are used to acting independently and quickly, in other cases it portends collapse and major losses, as well as trouble.";
"aceOfWands_financial" = "A favorable card that indicates an improvement in your financial situation, the rapid development of events and career growth. The card indicates that life gives you a chance to change your life for the better and gain a high income. In general, the card indicates the possibility of acquiring expensive and stylish things, unexpected and quick receipt of money, a favorable set of circumstances, quick income or unexpected profits.";
"aceOfCups_financial" = "The Ace of Cups promises you the fulfillment of an old dream - the best job, career advancement. In this context, it means that you have chosen a job for your soul. You are moving along your own path, fulfilling your destiny. The water element shows a good attitude of the authorities towards you, a positive psychological situation in the team. Work brings satisfaction, energizes. Direct card does not speak about finances. Whatever the income, he completely satisfies.";
"twoOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates instability in money and a game that may require you to spend a lot of money or spend. The card also portends you with additional earnings, doubts and the desire to acquire more than you now have. Sometimes it indicates the beginning of a new business and the acquisition of new opportunities.";
"twoOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates great difficulties in achieving wealth, doubts, fears and threats. Sometimes the card portends the beginning of an unpleasant period of time, a black streak and poverty, debts and a loss of stability and former prosperity. Something slowly undermines your strength and can deprive you of well-being, so you need to pay attention to the restoration of your vital resources. It can also indicate duplicity, or some dual situation in your affairs and work matters.";
"twoOfWands_financial" = "A favorable card that indicates a gradual improvement in the financial situation, but you should not expect brilliant results. You will earn no more than always, the card does not portend a rapid increase in income, but it does not indicate losses either. Rather, it portends stagnation in business, limited opportunities or being busy with business and domestic issues.";
"twoOfCups_financial" = "A card of novelty, insignificant profits and spending on petty pleasures. This card portends you a change of plans due to an unexpected meeting or a new acquaintance, which promises to bring change or a sense of novelty into your life. Perhaps you will get a wonderful business partner who you can rely on and who is not afraid to trust. It is also likely that you will spend money on hobbies or on friendly meetings, small pleasures and entertainment.";
"threeOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates the receipt of money, empowerment, large material resources and the ability to achieve your goals. You will be able to achieve what you want, but in some cases you may need help or consent from other people.";
"threeOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates great difficulties in achieving material wealth and action contrary to feelings for the sake of material well-being. You can betray yourself or others by doing a reasonable and practical action against your own or someone else's desires, which will not bring any joy and become a source of suffering. Also here, betrayal from the outside is likely.";
"threeOfWands_financial" = "The Three of Wands is an auspicious card that portends you to work, activity and getting money, stability in income or their gradual increase. The card may portend a reward for work, but only if you apply the maximum amount of perseverance, patience and work to achieve results and do your job well. The card promises quick cash profit, unexpected income or a new position with new responsibilities.";
"threeOfCups_financial" = "Map of holidays, spending, well-being and prosperity. This card indicates to you favorable opportunities, improvement of the situation, unexpected receipt of money or support, financial assistance from colleagues, close people or just acquaintances. Such a card may indicate that you will give someone or receive a very valuable and expensive gift.";
"fourOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates your stability and prosperity, a generous inheritance or the use of the resources of your kind and family for a good start in life and wealth, however, you will do your best to save what you have, and not spend money on what you really need. This card portends many favorable opportunities, stability and constant income.";
"fourOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates great difficulties and obstacles, forced inaction or delay in the payment of debts and loans. She also talks about troubles and illnesses, the inability to change the situation, as circumstances will force you to do something completely different from what you planned and for some time will knock you out of your usual rut.";
"fourOfWands_financial" = "A favorable card that portends you rest on your laurels, a stable financial position and significant achievements, enjoyment of what has been achieved, money that will contribute to material well-being and form the basis of existence. The card portends you a smooth and stable flow of money, the opportunity to relax and enjoy beautifully and comfortably.";
"fourOfCups_financial" = "A card of longing, loneliness and extravagance, which is unlikely to be reasonable and justified. In some cases, such a card may portend you suffering and a long period of lack of demand and failure, which can also result in financial losses. There may be a delay in financial assistance, failures, tears and great experiences in life, which will be fraught with missed chances for you.";
"fiveOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates significant losses in your life: debts, poverty, lack of prospects, dismissal, great worries associated with losses, material disorder. This card portends a complete absence of favorable opportunities at this stage, but much will depend on your practicality and determination.";
"fiveOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates cunning, anger and huge material losses associated with enmity. It is possible that in your environment there is a deceiver and a cunning person who is trying to harm you and do meanness in various ways. This card portends the negative consequences of an ill-considered act, blackmail and manipulation.";
"fiveOfWands_financial" = "Not the most favorable card in the layout for money and business matters. She portends you quarrels, disputes, litigation, damages and conflicts over money or difficult issues. In general, the card indicates to you difficulties in obtaining money, significant troubles and problems that will not lead to anything good. It can be quarrels and disputes over inheritance, division, competition for a tidbit and a place in the sun. Vividly reflects competition at the peak of a clash of interests.";
"fiveOfCups_financial" = "This is a card of major losses, worries and withdrawal, which can drag on for a long time for you. Such a card can portend major problems and troubles in life, delaying payments, failure to fulfill promises, and many difficulties in life. The card says that you are more focused on the lost and missed than on new opportunities and chances. You need to learn to let go of regrets and understand that everything is happening as it should and you should move on.";
"sixOfPentacles_financial" = "The card indicates wealth, stability and prosperity, a generous inheritance or the use of the resources of one's kind and family for a good start in life and wealth. This card portends you many favorable opportunities, stability and harmony in the family, which will contribute to success and prosperity.";
"sixOfSwords_financial" = "The card indicates a sudden change or departure from an unpleasant person or group of people. Most likely, you will have to change your place of residence in order to earn more or achieve your goals. Sometimes the card indicates exile and betrayal, a dismissal that will force you to stop spending for a while.";
"sixOfWands_financial" = "A map of change for the better for you, improving your financial situation and managing your finances. This card may portend you a new position, winning a case, the ability to cope with difficulties, sometimes it speaks of a generous fee, profit or inheritance, which will be very useful. In some cases, the card indicates a positive mood and victory in the fight for a cash prize.";
"sixOfCups_financial" = "A card of unexpected joy, pleasure, debt repayment, pleasant events and impressions. Sometimes she points to a gift for a child or a children's party in which you will take part. In some cases, the card portends difficulties and temporary financial setbacks, but for some people it portends a return of debt and a favorable set of circumstances.";
"sevenOfPentacles_financial" = "At present, your business, project, idea, if it is growing, then at a slow pace, the profit may not satisfy you, and sometimes it is completely absent. And yet there is some progress, but you still have to work long and hard to achieve the final goal. Definitely, the card speaks of the need for hard work, which will be accompanied by fatigue and a desire to rest. You need to evaluate the intermediate results and after a short rest move on. Hard work and patience can lead to career advancement. At the moment, the invested work does not pay off, in the future it is possible to receive a good reward. The Seven of Pentacles speaks of long-term projects to be pushed through by persistent work, do not expect quick results.";
"sevenOfSwords_financial" = "The Seven of Swords shows the need for you to reach your goal through certain maneuvers. If everything is well planned, good results can be achieved. A well-calculated situation is the key to easy overcoming difficulties and your real success. You can count on receiving important competent advice, even rather clever, support from a knowledgeable person, gaining new knowledge and strength. If the surrounding cards are unfavorable, then the Seven of Swords indicates dubious transactions, manipulations with documents and money, dark deeds. To make a profit in business, you will have to look for an unconventional approach, take risks and use methods that are not entirely honest.";
"sevenOfWands_financial" = "The card indicates to you determination and perseverance in your actions, the absence of doubt. You believe in yourself, are ready to go forward at any cost and overcome obstacles. The card speaks of your success, which can become a stumbling block for possible rivals. You stand on top, which means that you can easily get around your opponents. It is also important to understand that opponents are not always real. With such a card, you may not have them, but in your mind you will constantly try to get around someone. This for you can serve as a kind of motivation for career growth, and the Seven of Wands says that this success is more real than ever.";
"sevenOfCups_financial" = "In finance, you do not have very good prospects yet. Everything rests on the fact that at the moment you have nothing but unrealistic plans, projects and fantastic ideas. That's good enough for that. An additional complication is created by the fact that it takes a lot of time to discuss mythical projects. Basically, it is wasted. The card speaks of imaginary success, which is not confirmed in your realities. You prefer to be in an illusion, not agreeing to open your eyes to what is happening. The Seven of Cups denotes completely fruitless negotiations, the impossibility of transactions. You cannot assess the depth of the error because you take wishful thinking.";
"eightOfPentacles_financial" = "For businessmen, this card promises a successful business, because you came to its beginning in a very balanced and thoughtful way. You have set realistic goals that you can achieve, have developed ideal business tactics, have a natural instinct, common sense and foresight. It should be said that you have to get profitable orders, conclude serious successful deals. However, success will be ensured not only by your good start, but also by hard work, order and structuring of the company, the use of the latest technologies, and a serious attitude to the professionalism of employees. Profit will be received by you only with a prudent attitude, sufficient investment and hard work. If you are in search of work, then the Eight of Pentacles promises successful employment, dedication to the work process, and satisfaction from your work. In addition, the card indicates you the opportunity to show your professional abilities, as well as gain new experience, improve your skills.";
"eightOfSwords_financial" = "The Eight of Swords tells you about a rather difficult situation in the professional field. The card says that it is not easy for you to fulfill your official duties due to the fact that you constantly have to overcome some obstacles. An important element of these obstacles is your internal state - these are internal barriers and restrictions that do not allow you to develop, there may be an insufficient professional level, which makes you a weak employee. In addition to internal barriers, various restrictions from the leadership, constant cutting of wings, a huge number of rules and instructions can be obstacles for you. Also, this card speaks of a poorly organized business.";
"eightOfWands_financial" = "The Eight of Wands indicates a period of fast, almost swift action, a period of increased activity for you. It can also predict the rapid development of some previously suspended project. At the moment, everything that the confrontation had had has been neutralized, and events will develop unexpectedly. For business, the card shows your new opportunities for prosperity, a sharp push towards your plan. You will have to make a quick decision, you simply will not have time to build up and think. The main thing is to have time to do everything that fate will throw at you, because this is all the way to success. This is a business map associated with the introduction of new innovative technologies. The card also indicates the receipt of an unexpected offer, random favorable combinations of circumstances, significant meetings. The Eight of Wands can also speak of an unexpected change in your job or even activity. The most important thing is that you will have to delve into the nuances very quickly, work with the team, study the established rules.";
"eightOfCups_financial" = "The map shows that a difficult period has come. If earlier you had many ideas and directions, now you are forced to choose the most correct one. Choose thoughtfully and consciously, abandoning previous plans that, under the current circumstances, are becoming uninteresting or unrealistic for you. Because of the surrounding circumstances, you feel mired in a swamp, you cannot find motivation, while the previous motivations cease to exist for you. The card may even predict your forced departure from your previous job or the inability to continue the business direction you have begun. The Eight of Cups may even indicate that you need to change your profession. Quite often, such changes are forced, because you have simply outlived yourself, you need to move on. Only decisive withdrawal will open up new perspectives for you.";
"nineOfPentacles_financial" = "The card describes the pleasure after the work done and your enjoyment of its results, it does not characterize the idler and lazy person. This is a map of a successful, fruitful and joyful business life. She promises you good achievements, but with discipline and skill. This is a map of business success, the emergence and implementation of ideas, a good and promising start to a business, the successful completion of projects that have already begun. It portends you moving up the career ladder, receiving a financially and creatively advantageous offer, receiving well-deserved authority and high marks for your professionalism. Your business with such a card is completely protected, all investments will pay off, because you skillfully approach both business and financial matters. In addition, the card promises unexpected profits, rewards or bonuses.";
"nineOfSwords_financial" = "The Nine of Swords indicates that, of course, there are problems in a business or career, and they arose, first of all, due to indecision, doubts, fears of doing something, negative emotions. The card predicts a failed business for you, and if there is any minimal success, then it will be associated with severe stress, which can lead to depression, apathy and aversion to work. With such a card, you can say that your professional activity has become a real torture. You hardly force yourself to go to work, looking for any excuse to slip away from your duties. The blockage at work, which arose because of a negligent attitude towards her, makes you nervous and even deprives you of sleep.";
"nineOfWands_financial" = "The Nine of Wands in the layouts for work shows you as a very disciplined person who competently plans his affairs, knows how to withstand difficulties, and successfully fights problems. You are very determined in achieving your goals and are ready to endure any trials, just to reach the desired result. Your stubbornness makes you achieve everything at any cost. However, the card also speaks of your fatigue, even when the issue has not yet received a final resolution. If we are talking about a long-term project, then the card indicates to you a small breakthrough that can occur due to breaking through all the obstacles with your forehead. It is a victory gained in struggle. Sometimes it is a victory in the fight against competitors.";
"nineOfCups_financial" = "Perhaps this is one of the cards that is just perfect for a layout for work and business. Its meaning is your unconditional success, well-being, your victory over complex projects, achievement of the highest goals, incredible prospects for your business development. The card says that your business will have excellent advantages over competitors, it is fully built and all that remains is to maintain the previously chosen course. You can even afford a little rest, as it will not interfere with the development of your business in the least. As for career growth, everything here also speaks of bright prospects, about the right direction chosen and about getting satisfaction from the activity in which you are engaged.";
"tenOfPentacles_financial" = "Ten of Pentacles tells you about a very successful business, a high financial position. You need to understand that we are talking about an already existing business, built on the previously achieved. Everything that you could get from it is received. In fact, you could very well retire and receive dividends, but if you have the desire to increase your status, achieve the maximum career, invest in another business to increase your income, then success will await you. If you work for someone, then you are a person of a high professional level, who is appreciated in the team. The authorities prefer to keep you with any benefits, including a high level of wages. Another aspect may be hidden here: you are so dependent on your financial situation that you will not quit even a job that is boring and uninteresting for you because of high incomes. In addition, the card may indicate a premium, a worthy reward, a good profit.";
"tenOfSwords_financial" = "The Ten of Swords does not bode well. In fact, it shows you as a person burned out at work. You are completely exhausted, exhausted. Most likely, you have taken on exorbitant obligations that simply took away your last strength. There is nothing you can do now to continue working. The Ten of Swords is the logical conclusion of suffering from your own fears and negative thoughts, not having a restful sleep. As a result, you got completely exhausted and lost your last strength. You went to this for some time - a time of stress and worries, you even felt sick. And here is the result: complete impotence, in fact, mortal fatigue. In this state, you cease to be interesting to the employer, so the logical end is dismissal, and unexpected. It will be accompanied by painful experiences. It is sad that no one can stand up for you, you are practically unable to change anything. In business with such a card, a complete fiasco awaits you. All your undertakings are not viable today.";
"tenOfWands_financial" = "The Ten of Wands indicates that you are doing hard work for you. It can also be difficult working conditions. You do not see prospects, there are no opportunities for further advancement and career growth. The card also shows that you received what you wanted earlier, but at the moment the implementation of all your plans will be accompanied by difficulties. You may be successful, but the price will be very high. You have to pay for everything in this life, and recognition, improvement of life, power are no exception. Circumstances will not develop for you by themselves. The card indicates that you have a clear professional overload. You have had to make commitments, the fulfillment of which is fraught with difficulties and problems. This may denote you as a person with high ambitions and limited opportunities to realize them. You overestimated the prospects that opened up earlier, took on the burden of responsibility, and at the moment you are trying with all your might to keep the situation under control.";
"tenOfCups_financial" = "Congratulations on your incredible success. You were able to achieve everything that was possible, which will make you feel like a triumph. Everything you do, you adore. Activities bring you both material and emotional satisfaction. However, the card also indicates that the time has come for you to move to a qualitatively new level, since the present one will no longer be able to bring that satisfaction due to full implementation. Roughly speaking, there is no way to move on. This is the pinnacle of your career. The card can also tell you about the recognition of merits that are especially noted by others, glory and honor. In fact, this is the acquisition of unquestioning authority, which will already serve further well-being and prosperity. If we are talking about a team, then this map shows the most favorable disposition of employees to each other. The team is close-knit and works like a family.";
